'''Pure Gold R.Ost''' (純金倶楽部, ''Junkin Kurabu'', '''Pure Gold Club''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[R.Ost]] that appears in [[Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Pure Gold R.Ost
|image = E 338.png
|first appearance = [[GOLD RUSH#The Midas Touch|The Midas Touch]]
'''ZL''': [[Metallic Metaverse|Sub-chapter 11 - Metallic Metaverse]]
|money drop = 540¢ - 2,133¢
}}

==Enemy==
Pure Gold R.Ost shares many similarities with the common [[R.Ost]]: fast attack rate, high DPS, decent speed... However, it has very low health and lacks the ability to do [[Critical Hit]]s. Use [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] to take it down easier. Despite being the strongest golden enemy in [[GOLD RUSH#The Midas Touch|The Midas Touch]], it has a lower money drop than both [[Golden Doge]] and [[Gold Hippoe]].

==Strategy==
Pure Gold R.Ost can be treated as a [[Metal Doge]] with longer range. Use fast-attacking and/or ranged cats such as [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] or [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]] to take it out quickly. If you need to use [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]], then [[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Hayabusa]], [[Marauder Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Marauder Cat]], [[Graveflower Verbena (Uber Rare Cat)|Graveflower Verbena]] or [[Sakura Sonic (Uber Rare Cat)|Sakura Sonic]] are some of your best choices.

