==Trivia==
*Like [[R.Ost]], Pure Gold R.Ost's Japanese name, Junkin Kurabu (純金倶楽部, "Pure Gold Club"), is a reference to the comedy trio  [[wikipedia:ja:ダチョウ倶楽部|Dachō Club]] (ダチョウ倶楽部 ''Dachō Kurabu'', "Ostrich Club"). R.Ost's Japanese name can also be taken as "Dachō Club" ("Ostrich Club"), but uses a different word for "club" (同好会 ''Dōkōkai'') instead of 倶楽部 ''Kurabu'', which ''is'' used in Pure Gold R.Ost's, and as such the two enemies' names can be combined to form the comedy trio's name:
**<u>ダチョウ</u>同好会 ''<u>Dachō</u> Dōkōkai'' + 純金<u>倶楽部</u> ''Junkin <u>Kurabu</u>'' = ダチョウ倶楽部 ''Dachō Kurabu''

